# Generated wholesale from lessons/, assets/ and reference/ by tools/build-course.py.
# Nothing here is a source of truth, and at ~1 MB a build it would dominate the
# history within a week. Vercel rebuilds it on deploy; run the builder locally to
# read it offline.
dist/
site/

# Vercel CLI link state — project and org ids for this machine.
.vercel/

# Claude Code's per-machine permission grants. CLAUDE.md and AGENTS.md are the
# shared instructions and they *are* tracked.
.claude/settings.local.json

.DS_Store

# Candid working notes, and the repo is public. NOTES.md is the accumulated memory
# of the project and learning-records/ is session history — both are read every
# session but neither is shipped, and neither is anyone else's business.
# Consequence worth knowing: they now have no backup but the working copy.
NOTES.md
learning-records/
